		{
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0001]"
				""
				"Good morning, Reclamation Operator. The world has moved on, and most of it moved away."
				"What remains is this fragment, one ruined NCP kiosk, and you."
				""
				"Your assignment: rebuild the North Central Positronics network, one tier at a time."
				"Nothing here has ore. Nothing here spawns. Everything you will ever own, you will &areclaim&r, &aprocess&r or &aremember&r."
				""
				"&eOpen this book any time with the quest key. Claim rewards with the button on each quest."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:lantern"
			id: "504F530000001001"
			rewards: [{
				count: 3
				id: "504F530000003001"
				item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
				type: "item"
			}]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 2.0d
			subtitle: "Welcome to the Waste Lands"
			tasks: [{
				id: "504F530000002001"
				title: "Read the memo"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "The World Has Moved On"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["504F530000001001"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0002: Reclamation Units]"
				""
				"Your kit holds four &bMk I Reclamation Generators&r: cobblestone, dirt, sand and gravel."
				"Place one and it slowly pulls matter in from the void. No power needed at this grade."
				""
				"Take items out by hand, or let a hopper or pipe do it for you."
				"&7Tip: a hopper into a chest means the generator keeps working while you are away."
			]
			id: "504F530000001002"
			rewards: [{
				count: 2
				id: "504F530000003002"
				item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "Matter from nothing (slowly)"
			tasks: [{
				count: 64L
				id: "504F530000002002"
				item: "minecraft:cobblestone"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Reclamation Mk I"
			x: 2.5d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["504F530000001001"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0003: Hydration Policy]"
				""
				"You have a &bthirst&r bar now. Drinking raw water is a bad idea: it is dirty, and it will make you sick."
				""
				"&aBoil it:&r put a water bottle on the campfire from your kit. After half a minute it is purified."
				"Later, a &bWater Purifier&r does this much faster (it needs copper)."
				""
				"The little spring on the island never runs dry. Your canteen holds several drinks."
				"&7NCP reminds you that dehydration is not covered by your contract."
			]
			id: "504F530000001003"
			rewards: [{
				count: 2
				id: "504F530000003003"
				item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "Thirst, and how to survive it"
			tasks: [{
				count: 2L
				id: "504F530000002003"
				item: "toughasnails:purified_water_bottle"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Water Is Life"
			x: 2.5d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["504F530000001003"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0004: Thermal Comfort]"
				""
				"Your body has a &btemperature&r. Nights, rain and winter push it down; heat sources push it up."
				""
				"&aStay warm:&r stand near your campfire, keep dry, and craft &bleaf armor&r from leaves for mild weather."
				"Later, wool armor and a Thermoregulator will keep a whole room comfortable."
				""
				"Here is a thermometer, so you can see trouble before it finds you."
			]
			id: "504F530000001004"
