			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0005: Seasonal Planning]"
				""
				"Time passes in &bseasons&r here: spring, summer, autumn, winter."
				"Crops planted in the world grow only in the seasons they like, and winter is cold."
				""
				"&aPlan ahead:&r store food before winter and keep a warm place to stand."
				"Take this calendar so you always know what is coming."
			]
